<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Plants" id="00126e46" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsWhite" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;¿Sabías que tu vida depende de las plantas? Las plantas liberan un gas llamado oxígeno, que necesitas para respirar. También nos proporcionan los alimentos que necesitamos para sobrevivir.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Plantas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126e46_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="77" y="351"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Cactus&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>196</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>197</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Cactus&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="73" y="352" w="54" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="282" y="161"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Aleluya&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>205</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>204</x><y>186</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>184</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>205</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Aleluya&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="278" y="162" w="59" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="270" y="351"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Frambuesas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>203</x><y>192</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>205</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>203</x><y>192</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Frambuesas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="266" y="352" w="90" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B823A17,1B8230F7,1B823143</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Plantas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="2"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Una planta tiene tres partes principales: raíces, tallo y hojas. Las raíces fijan la planta al suelo y absorben el agua y las sales minerales de la tierra. El tallo sostiene la planta y transporta en su interior el agua, las sales minerales y el alimento por toda la planta. Las hojas fabrican el alimento a partir de la luz del Sol, el aire, el agua y las sales minerales. La planta utiliza ese alimento para crecer.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Partes de la planta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126e46_2.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="82" y="304"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>40</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>130</x><y>314</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Raíces&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Raíces&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="78" y="305" w="52" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="253" y="126"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-54</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>249</x><y>136</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tallo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tallo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="249" y="127" w="43" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="253" y="66"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-23</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>249</x><y>76</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hoja&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hoja&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="249" y="67" w="41" h="17"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="33" y="229"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Suelo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Suelo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="29" y="230" w="46" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>29D29313</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Partes de la planta&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los árboles son las plantas más altas. Los árboles más altos son las secuoyas gigantes, que pueden superar el tamaño de un rascacielos de 30 plantas y vivir más de 2.000 años. Pero los organismos vivos más antiguos que hay sobre la Tierra son los pinos de Bristlecone, que pueden llegar a vivir 5.000 años.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Árboles&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126e46_4.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="154" y="354"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Secuoya gigante&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>374</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Secuoya gigante&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="150" y="355" w="118" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>25A3FC78</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Árboles&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Muchas plantas producen flores de colores brillantes y llamativos. El color y el olor de las flores atrae a las abejas y a otros insectos. Los insectos ayudan a que las flores produzcan semillas, necesarias para crear nuevas plantas, transportando un polvo llamado polen de una planta a otra.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Flores&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126e46_5.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="154" y="351"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Jardín con flores&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>373</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Jardín con flores&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="150" y="352" w="124" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B82993A</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Flores&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="5" slideid="6"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Una de las plantas más sorprendentes es la venus atrapamoscas. Si un insecto se posa en sus hojas, éstas se cierran y la planta empieza a digerirlo. La mayoría de las venus atrapamoscas se alimentan de moscas, arañas, orugas y babosas. La planta que puedes ver en la fotografía ha capturado una pequeña rana.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Plantas carnívoras&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126e46_6.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="142" y="358"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Venus atrapamoscas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>372</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Venus atrapamoscas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="138" y="359" w="146" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B826792</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Plantas carnívoras&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="4" textdividerbarcolorid="4" creditsbuttonstyleid="4" resetbuttonstyleid="5" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="0" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="4" progresscolorid="4" guttercolorid="4" graphiccolorid="4" outlinecolorid="4" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="5" displaytextstyleid="5" selectedlisttextstyleid="5" rolllisttextstyleid="5" downlisttextstyleid="5" rolloutlinecolorid="5" displaybgcolorid="2" listbgcolorid="2" listoutlinecolorid="5" displayoutlinecolorid="5" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="5" thumbbasecolorid="6" thumbrollcolorid="7" thumbdowncolorid="7" buttonstyleid="1"/></popmenustyle><captionscrollbarstyle guttercolorid="5" thumbbasecolorid="6" thumbrollcolorid="7" thumbdowncolorid="7" buttonstyleid="1"/><creditsbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Credits&lt;/html&gt;</creditsbuttontext><resetbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Reset&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><currentslidetext textstyleid="6"><text>&lt;html&gt;% de #&lt;/html&gt;</text></currentslidetext></slideshowcontrol><textstyles><textstyle size="15" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="8" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="8" align="left" id="2"/><textstyle size="15" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="8" id="3" align="left"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic